# Findings in uv.lock that are accepted rather than fixed.
#
# Passed to Trivy by scripts/security/lib.sh. One finding identifier per line,
# followed by exp:YYYY-MM-DD, under a comment naming the exception that argues
# it. Every identifier here is an accepted exception in
# docs/security/security-baseline.v1alpha1.json and
# docs/security/deferred-risks.md, and tests/security/ refuses an identifier no
# exception names and an exception naming one that is not here.
#
# None is accepted. The file exists so that the guard and the baseline read the
# same list, and the guard refuses to scan without it, so deleting it cannot
# quietly change what blocks.
